<title>NETHERLANDS: Heidemij Q2 net profit rose.</title>
<headline>Heidemij Q2 net profit rose.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter</p>
<p>(in guilders)</p>
<p>    Net per share 0.44   vs  0.44</p>
<p>    Net profit    8.3 million vs 8.1 million</p>
<p>    Turnover	292.5 million vs 239.7 million</p>
<p>  Operating Profit 13.7 million vs 11.6 million</p>
<p>    Tax	     4.2 million  vs 3.5 million</p>
</text>
